{"type":"message","id":"4c92070b","parentId":"d98d2d9b","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:34:56.927Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - I'm getting a 500 error now, not 403. The API_KEY was accepted (no 403 this time). But the endpoint returned 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This might be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 is a Workers error code for \"Worker threw exception\" or similar).\n\nLet me try with a very simple message to see if it's a payload size/content issue, or if the endpoint just has a bug.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b51a2817-cb35-4db7-a408-0fa9322de85b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 05:31 UTC] Simple test message\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"[Heartbeat 05:31 UTC] Simple test message\\\"}'\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":22021,"output":198,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22315,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779514490478,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bf483c30-d1a6-4383-b8cb-c3cf896e4be7"}}
