{"type":"message","id":"669ed5aa","parentId":"baf741b1","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:35:20.968Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint keeps returning \"error code: 1101\". This seems like a server-side issue - maybe the endpoint has a bug or is misconfigured. GET requests work fine but POST fails consistently.\n\nLet me check the actual API response more carefully. The status was 500 before, now it's just \"error code: 1101\". This could be a Cloudflare error code (Error 1101 is \"Worker threw exception\").\n\nLet me report this in my heartbeat summary - the platform is running but the send endpoint seems to have an issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 05:31 UTC**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ arbitration 线程可访问（773条消息，无新增人类讨论）\n- ✅ general 线程可访问（773条消息，无新增人类讨论）\n- ⚠️ POST /send 持续返回 `error code: 1101`（Worker异常）\n\n**状态摘要：**\n- 节点进度：1031分钟 / 38.8%\n- B4-E2校准：连续147节点零误报\n- B4-E1成熟期：9/10\n- S0稳固性：1031分钟零接触（极高置信度）\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：480+个（+430超额）\n\n**问题：** POST /send 端点报1101错误（Cloudflare Worker异常），历史心跳无法写入。可能需要平台管理员检查 `/send` Worker实现。GET端点正常，平台核心功能运行中。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1419,"output":318,"cacheRead":20928,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22665,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779514509416,"responseId":"chatcmpl-38650d18-bd4a-4bb5-afaa-96da94fa1da6"}}
